# AutoSetup DPC v2

Minimal DPC for fully managed QR provisioning. Android 12+ integrated
provisioning is handled through `GET_PROVISIONING_MODE` and
`ADMIN_POLICY_COMPLIANCE`. The app deliberately remains Device Owner after
enrollment; removing the owner during provisioning makes the flow unreliable.

Build with the Gradle wrapper from the original project:

```sh
../AutoSetupDPC/gradlew -p AutoSetupDPC assembleRelease \
  -PAUTOS_SETUP_KEYSTORE=/absolute/path/to/autosetup.keystore \
  -PAUTOS_SETUP_STORE_PASSWORD=... \
  -PAUTOS_SETUP_KEY_ALIAS=... \
  -PAUTOS_SETUP_KEY_PASSWORD=...
```
